WEBVTT

00:00:01.287 --> 00:00:02.010
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.444
<v><b>F:</b></v> Success is 99 per cent failure.

00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:09.245
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.386 --> 00:00:14.214
<v><b>M:</b></v> You have to go through some adversity to be successful.

00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:17.121
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.241 --> 00:00:24.581
<v><b>F:</b></v> Use what you’ve been through as fuel, believe in yourself and be unstoppable.

00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:27.379
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:28.441 --> 00:00:33.811
<v><b>M:</b></v> A hero is an ordinary individual who finds the strength to persevere

00:00:33.836 --> 00:00:37.621
and endure in spite of overwhelming obstacles.

00:00:39.574 --> 00:00:40.408
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:41.457 --> 00:00:50.142
<v><b>F:</b></v> He who believes is strong; he who doubts is weak. Strong convictions precede great actions.

00:00:52.237 --> 00:00:53.030
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:57.593
<v><b>M:</b></v> Sometimes you don’t realize your own strength

00:00:57.665 --> 00:01:01.803
until you come face to face with your greatest weakness.

00:01:03.851 --> 00:01:04.637
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:10.240
<v><b>F:</b></v> Some people will just go with the flow of things in life,

00:01:10.772 --> 00:01:16.743
while others will fight against the currents and go upstream to reach their destiny.